= Latest bash on MacOS

`
brew install bash
sudo sh -c 'echo /opt/homebrew/bin/bash >> /etc/shells'
chsh -s /opt/homebrew/bin/bash
`

Scripts need to use "#!/usr/bin/env bash" in order to use the brew-bash, not "#!/bin/bash"

= Neovim

`
git submodule update --init
`

`
brew install nvim
brew install ripgrep
`

Some of the LSP servers need npm to install/run:

`
brew install npm
`

lazy.nvim (plugin manager) is auto-bootstrapped by init.lua. If needed, see: https://github.com/folke/lazy.nvim
